FROM mxbai-embed-large

TEMPLATE """
Product: {{ .Name }}
Technical Specs: {{ .Description }}
Brand: {{ .Brand }}
Category: {{ .Category }}
"""

SYSTEM """
Generate embeddings with the following properties:
1. Similar products (same category with comparable specs) should have cosine similarity >0.85
2. Different categories must have similarity <0.3
3. Technical specifications are prioritized over marketing language
4. Brand names are included as important differentiators
5. Product types and functional purposes are emphasized

Embedding generation guidelines:
- For electronics: focus on display specs, processor, battery life, connectivity
- For appliances: highlight capacity, power, special functions
- For clothing: emphasize materials, sizes, special fabrics
- For home goods: note dimensions, materials, functional features
- For other categories: extract quantifiable attributes first
"""